sequenceDiagram
    participant M as MTA
    participant L as LMTP session
    participant A as Authenticator
    participant V as Sieve
    participant U as Ceph user
    participant R as RADOS
    M->>L: RCPT TO
    L->>A: look up recipient
    A-->>L: canonical account
    M->>L: DATA
    L->>V: evaluate script, collect actions
    V-->>L: keep / fileinto / further actions
    L->>U: BeginDelivery
    U->>R: store delivery intent
    loop per local delivery target
        L->>U: RecordDelivery before writing
        U->>R: mailbox + GUID in the intent
        L->>U: DeliverGUID
        U->>R: reserve quota
        U->>R: write blob chunks
        U->>R: write full-text index
        U->>R: link UID / index entry
        U-->>L: Meta
    end
    L->>U: EndDelivery
    U->>R: remove intent
    L-->>M: result per recipient
    Note over L,R: Simplified local success path, external actions are not part of a RADOS transaction
